  "description": {
   "en": "Pairing: Kageyama Tobio/Hinata Shouyou  \n  \nHinata has a problem–he’s in love with Kageyama, and he knows that’s just asking for trouble. Since he can’t stop loving Kageyama, he decides to be as annoying and frustrating as possible in the hopes that he’ll piss off Kageyama enough that he’ll eventually get fed up with him and hate Hinata, thereby freeing him to no longer be in love."
